      en: ["The fort was constructed in 1891 by Sheikh Zayed the First.", "It is one of the largest mud-brick buildings in the United Arab Emirates.", "The structure houses a permanent gallery for explorer Wilfred Thesiger.", "The fort served as a summer residence for the ruling Al Nahyan family.", "A comprehensive restoration project was completed in the year 2008.", "The fort was originally established to protect the oasis and its water wells."],
